## Summary

Fuse the NVFP4 activation quantize of MiniMax-H3 into the kernels that produce the activations, so the four `quantize_with_block_size` launches per transformer block disappear:

- the AdaLN RMSNorm + modulation and the SwiGLU producers write NVFP4 codes and swizzled e4m3 block scales directly (`fused_quant.py`, Triton);
- the MLP residual add is folded into the next block's norm (`H3_LEVER10_FOLD=1`);
- the attention output is quantized by a bandwidth-bound Triton kernel (`fused_out_quant.py`) instead of the stock launch (104 → 43 µs at 19k tokens).

